<title>USA: USDA puts crop progress report to bed until April.</title>
<headline>USDA puts crop progress report to bed until April.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department said it has put its weekly crop progress report to bed until Spring.</p>
<p>USDA said it will issue the next crop progress report on April 7, 1997. The last report on the condition of U.S. crops was released December 2.</p>
</text>
